(3852807, 546211, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the slow shutter effect with this waterfall while contrasting it against the plants in the foreground. I wish the waterfall didn''t have such a muddy look but that isn''t something you can control. What is the red dot in the upper right corner. Great shot.</td>', 'Nice use of the slow shutter effect with this waterfall while contrasting it against the plants in the foreground. I wish the waterfall didn''t have such a muddy look but that isn''t something you can control. What is the red dot in the upper right corner. Great shot.', '2007-07-01 05:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
