(3852819, 535378, 9668, '<td valign="top">Ooohh, this will score well. Great DOF, and contrast. My only critique would be that the border is distracting but that is more of an opinion than critique. Maybe it being slighty noisy? Meh, that doesn''t bother me.</td>', 'Ooohh, this will score well. Great DOF, and contrast. My only critique would be that the border is distracting but that is more of an opinion than critique. Maybe it being slighty noisy? Meh, that doesn''t bother me.', '2007-07-01 05:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3852822, 545890, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot: that it shows a slice of everyday life. That being said, I think you could have really enhanced this image more in post processing. Why is the largest size only 560px rather than 640px? I think you could have pushed the contrast and color a bit more as well. The composition feels odd to me: the horses are the focal point to me and as soon as I look at them, I want to see where they are going so my eye is led off the frame. It would be a better composition to have them leading into the image.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot: that it shows a slice of everyday life. That being said, I think you could have really enhanced this image more in post processing. Why is the largest size only 560px rather than 640px? I think you could have pushed the contrast and color a bit more as well. The composition feels odd to me: the horses are the focal point to me and as soon as I look at them, I want to see where they are going so my eye is led off the frame. It would be a better composition to have them leading into the image.', '2007-07-01 05:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3852823, 546110, 9668, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting and simplicity of this shot. I can''t figure out what you''ve done to make it seem so soft yet still so sharp. Looks like this image has had some Tone Mapping or Shadow/Highlight filter applied (not a bad thing, but there is just a lot of workable tonal value).</td>', 'Like the lighting and simplicity of this shot. I can''t figure out what you''ve done to make it seem so soft yet still so sharp. Looks like this image has had some Tone Mapping or Shadow/Highlight filter applied (not a bad thing, but there is just a lot of workable tonal value).', '2007-07-01 05:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3852824, 543924, 9668, '<td valign="top">marbo? He does a lot infrared shots, usually with water though. This castle scene is very cool. The composition works very well with the lines leading into it. Why is the sky right above the castle darker then the rest of the sky?</td>', 'marbo? He does a lot infrared shots, usually with water though. This castle scene is very cool. The composition works very well with the lines leading into it. Why is the sky right above the castle darker then the rest of the sky?', '2007-07-01 05:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
