(3852850, 542758, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awesome! The light rays, the reflection, the silhouettes of the kids in different stages of of play: just great. I think the composition of this image could have been improved though. The horizon is almost dead center. Did you think about putting the horizon on the upper rule of thirds and standing a bit closer to the children (as to make them larger and more predominate in your image)? Couldn''t come up with a more creative title? Great capture though.</td>', 'Awesome! The light rays, the reflection, the silhouettes of the kids in different stages of of play: just great. I think the composition of this image could have been improved though. The horizon is almost dead center. Did you think about putting the horizon on the upper rule of thirds and standing a bit closer to the children (as to make them larger and more predominate in your image)? Couldn''t come up with a more creative title? Great capture though.', '2007-07-01 06:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
