(3856754, 545910, 74078, '<td valign="top">On my screen this image appears to have a very slight line through it just at the level of the girls nose, perhaps the distant coastline. Removal of this, thus creating freespace above the foreground grass would improve the overall effect (POP) of this shot. I like the shot though, 7</td>', 'On my screen this image appears to have a very slight line through it just at the level of the girls nose, perhaps the distant coastline. Removal of this, thus creating freespace above the foreground grass would improve the overall effect (POP) of this shot. I like the shot though, 7', '2007-07-02 08:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856756, 528427, 74078, '<td valign="top">Nice. Reminds me of some sort of African Safari shot. Great colours and use of shadows. Would look fantastic large. 7</td>', 'Nice. Reminds me of some sort of African Safari shot. Great colours and use of shadows. Would look fantastic large. 7', '2007-07-02 08:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856758, 545864, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great timing. Shots of lightening never cease to amaze me. I love them. This would have been awesome for you if the night had been completely still (pretty impossible in storms). The reflections of the water would have been great. Nice colours through the forks of lightening. 7</td>', 'Great timing. Shots of lightening never cease to amaze me. I love them. This would have been awesome for you if the night had been completely still (pretty impossible in storms). The reflections of the water would have been great. Nice colours through the forks of lightening. 7', '2007-07-02 08:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856762, 546138, 74078, '<td valign="top">IMO copping some of the shadow out of the bottom to bring the fenceline and gateway down would improve this shot. Were the clouds at the top completely dark at the time or where they scattered with some light showing through. More of the scattered clouds at the top and less shadowed foreground at the bottom of the shot would be awesome. Great work. 7</td>', 'IMO copping some of the shadow out of the bottom to bring the fenceline and gateway down would improve this shot. Were the clouds at the top completely dark at the time or where they scattered with some light showing through. More of the scattered clouds at the top and less shadowed foreground at the bottom of the shot would be awesome. Great work. 7', '2007-07-02 08:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856764, 545948, 74078, '<td valign="top">I think that I have recently viewed the portfolio of the owner of this shot. Great horse photography, and if it is not the photog that I think it is then I am more impressed. 9</td>', 'I think that I have recently viewed the portfolio of the owner of this shot. Great horse photography, and if it is not the photog that I think it is then I am more impressed. 9', '2007-07-02 08:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856765, 544325, 74078, '<td valign="top">No doubt you probably tossed up whether or not to keep the colour in cameramans shirt label. IMO just the colour in the main subject would have been great. The cameraman stands out without the small bit of colour you have kept as he is the only one in shot without a uniform on. Nice shot. 7</td>', 'No doubt you probably tossed up whether or not to keep the colour in cameramans shirt label. IMO just the colour in the main subject would have been great. The cameraman stands out without the small bit of colour you have kept as he is the only one in shot without a uniform on. Nice shot. 7', '2007-07-02 08:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856768, 545895, 74078, '<td valign="top">I am not entirely sure what was intended to be the main subject in this shot. Perhaps it was the pin, perhaps the thimble. Part of the thimble is in focus along with the pin and this is where I am unsure.</td>', 'I am not entirely sure what was intended to be the main subject in this shot. Perhaps it was the pin, perhaps the thimble. Part of the thimble is in focus along with the pin and this is where I am unsure.', '2007-07-02 08:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856770, 533651, 74078, '<td valign="top">This shot has the appearance of a snapshot rather than a challenge entry. I think that when the challenge is over and the shot details are presented it will show that it was taken from a great distance with a long lens. I suspect that it was taken handheld, which I suspect is why it appears slightly shakey.</td>', 'This shot has the appearance of a snapshot rather than a challenge entry. I think that when the challenge is over and the shot details are presented it will show that it was taken from a great distance with a long lens. I suspect that it was taken handheld, which I suspect is why it appears slightly shakey.', '2007-07-02 08:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856773, 545901, 74078, '<td valign="top">Awesome contrasting colours and a clever find. Nice clarity and very eye catching . Good placement of the main subject/s of the shot. 8</td>', 'Awesome contrasting colours and a clever find. Nice clarity and very eye catching . Good placement of the main subject/s of the shot. 8', '2007-07-02 08:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856775, 546052, 74078, '<td valign="top">Fantastic crispness. I am always impressed to see photography of birds with such a crispness as this shot displays. 7</td>', 'Fantastic crispness. I am always impressed to see photography of birds with such a crispness as this shot displays. 7', '2007-07-02 08:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856777, 545344, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great work. Fast little critters and they are a very photogenic bird. I love the clarity you have captured in the head and neck area of this bird. They appear to be shielded like some sort of knights chain mail armour. 9 IMO. Well done.</td>', 'Great work. Fast little critters and they are a very photogenic bird. I love the clarity you have captured in the head and neck area of this bird. They appear to be shielded like some sort of knights chain mail armour. 9 IMO. Well done.', '2007-07-02 08:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856780, 538964, 74078, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait of a big cat here. 10 10 10 I really like it and think that the BW conversion is amazing for this shot. Hopefully you have a colour version available for view after the challenge is over. Well done</td>', 'Fantastic portrait of a big cat here. 10 10 10 I really like it and think that the BW conversion is amazing for this shot. Hopefully you have a colour version available for view after the challenge is over. Well done', '2007-07-02 08:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856853, 543138, 62812, '<td valign="top">wow,this is one of the better shots this month.<br/>What wonderful texture and the warmth of the land is a treat against that cool sky.<br/>8</td>', 'wow,this is one of the better shots this month.What wonderful texture and the warmth of the land is a treat against that cool sky.8', '2007-07-02 08:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856907, 541801, 74078, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but not sure about the finished product. I think that the light spot on the train is too much of a distraction from the other great colours created  in the image. The two smaller lights in the middle are not too bad, but perhaps another position along the tracks without these two lights would have been a better option. Not sure when or for how long you exposed this but maybe to lessen the main light starting the shot earlier, (while further away) would lessen the effect. If this was the effect you were after then I congratulate you.</td>', 'I like the concept, but not sure about the finished product. I think that the light spot on the train is too much of a distraction from the other great colours created  in the image. The two smaller lights in the middle are not too bad, but perhaps another position along the tracks without these two lights would have been a better option. Not sure when or for how long you exposed this but maybe to lessen the main light starting the shot earlier, (while further away) would lessen the effect. If this was the effect you were after then I congratulate you.', '2007-07-02 09:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856914, 545758, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The proud parents of this baby would be elated at the effect you have acheived. 9</td>', 'Great portrait. The proud parents of this baby would be elated at the effect you have acheived. 9', '2007-07-02 09:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856919, 545500, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Fantastic colouring and nice composition. 7</td>', 'Great capture. Fantastic colouring and nice composition. 7', '2007-07-02 09:23:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3856923, 543132, 74078, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, but not too sure about the crop. I think that the crop is a little tight on the dolphin. More room above the dolphin might have given the shot more impact on me. 7</td>', 'I like the concept here, but not too sure about the crop. I think that the crop is a little tight on the dolphin. More room above the dolphin might have given the shot more impact on me. 7', '2007-07-02 09:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856940, 545251, 74078, '<td valign="top">Beauty. Elegance. 2 things that I noticed on viewing this shot closer. The OOF grass/reed in the bottom left corner. A quick clone could remove this would improve the shot. The other is how close the crop is to this beautiful womans face. The close crop is effective with the angle of the shot, but it appears to cut part of the top of her head off. I give it an 8, but with these 2 minor things different, I would have given 9 perhaps 10.</td>', 'Beauty. Elegance. 2 things that I noticed on viewing this shot closer. The OOF grass/reed in the bottom left corner. A quick clone could remove this would improve the shot. The other is how close the crop is to this beautiful womans face. The close crop is effective with the angle of the shot, but it appears to cut part of the top of her head off. I give it an 8, but with these 2 minor things different, I would have given 9 perhaps 10.', '2007-07-02 09:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856947, 545886, 74078, '<td valign="top">Nice model and I like the angle used in your lighting of her. Some images with similar lighting loose detail in the opposite side of the face, but you have managed to expose this well enough to maintain detail throughout. Well done, 8</td>', 'Nice model and I like the angle used in your lighting of her. Some images with similar lighting loose detail in the opposite side of the face, but you have managed to expose this well enough to maintain detail throughout. Well done, 8', '2007-07-02 09:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856959, 543674, 74078, '<td valign="top">I like your shot. Great colouring and lighting. 8. It does however, make me wonder what he is working on. Another angle to this shot, maybe from an elevated level would also have an impact, giving the viewer more of a picture of what he is working at.</td>', 'I like your shot. Great colouring and lighting. 8. It does however, make me wonder what he is working on. Another angle to this shot, maybe from an elevated level would also have an impact, giving the viewer more of a picture of what he is working at.', '2007-07-02 09:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856973, 537474, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great character. Nice clarity and crispness in all the detail of his weathered skin. The only thing I can think of to comment on for possible improvements would be to have the main subject further to the left, with some space in the direction that he is looking, and perhaps trying to lessen the highlights that have appeared to have blown out on his shoulders. Nice portrait though and I can not score it any lower than I think it deserves because of what I feel could make it better. 9</td>', 'Great character. Nice clarity and crispness in all the detail of his weathered skin. The only thing I can think of to comment on for possible improvements would be to have the main subject further to the left, with some space in the direction that he is looking, and perhaps trying to lessen the highlights that have appeared to have blown out on his shoulders. Nice portrait though and I can not score it any lower than I think it deserves because of what I feel could make it better. 9', '2007-07-02 09:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3856997, 543759, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Great lighting. Great subject. 10. I would have like to see this shot with equal lighting on both sides of the model, ie the neck area and ears. Still 10 for me. Well done</td>', 'Great shot. Great lighting. Great subject. 10. I would have like to see this shot with equal lighting on both sides of the model, ie the neck area and ears. Still 10 for me. Well done', '2007-07-02 09:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857024, 546229, 74078, '<td valign="top">IMO this is a slightly boring shot. Freespace yes, but the main subject in the shot have very little appeal. It also appears that processing has caused some slight halo effects around the topmost part of the spire.</td>', 'IMO this is a slightly boring shot. Freespace yes, but the main subject in the shot have very little appeal. It also appears that processing has caused some slight halo effects around the topmost part of the spire.', '2007-07-02 09:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857033, 546158, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great processing. Not sure that I like the grainy feel to this, but that is my opinion only. I would like to see how this shot started out to see just how much work was involved in this finished product. Nice work</td>', 'Great processing. Not sure that I like the grainy feel to this, but that is my opinion only. I would like to see how this shot started out to see just how much work was involved in this finished product. Nice work', '2007-07-02 09:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857040, 543318, 74078, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, not sure about the processing though. It appears to have a slight haze over it which takes away from the spectacular scene.</td>', 'I like the shot, not sure about the processing though. It appears to have a slight haze over it which takes away from the spectacular scene.', '2007-07-02 09:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857053, 546227, 74078, '<td valign="top">Now that is macro. Real close. Well I think it is. Is it the centre of a flower?</td>', 'Now that is macro. Real close. Well I think it is. Is it the centre of a flower?', '2007-07-02 09:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857067, 545462, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great wedding shot. You have really captured the emotion of the day in this shot. Good choice of processing and colour selection. The flowers in her left hand appear to be slightly out of focus (motion blur). 8</td>', 'Great wedding shot. You have really captured the emotion of the day in this shot. Good choice of processing and colour selection. The flowers in her left hand appear to be slightly out of focus (motion blur). 8', '2007-07-02 09:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857094, 546171, 74078, '<td valign="top">Perfect choice of title, model, composition, lighting, soft feel, everything. My attention is immediately drawn to her captivating eyes in this pose. Some may comment on the foreground being distracting (as I have seen in past challenges) but to me it adds to the shot. 10</td>', 'Perfect choice of title, model, composition, lighting, soft feel, everything. My attention is immediately drawn to her captivating eyes in this pose. Some may comment on the foreground being distracting (as I have seen in past challenges) but to me it adds to the shot. 10', '2007-07-02 09:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857101, 546214, 74078, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot but am not entirely sure I like the blue hue on the normally pure white bird. I can understand that the reflections may have caused it but some adjustments might bring it back a bit.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot but am not entirely sure I like the blue hue on the normally pure white bird. I can understand that the reflections may have caused it but some adjustments might bring it back a bit.', '2007-07-02 09:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857115, 545496, 74078, '<td valign="top">These shots never cease to impress me. They always leave me envying the photographer and the skills protrayed by the work. 10</td>', 'These shots never cease to impress me. They always leave me envying the photographer and the skills protrayed by the work. 10', '2007-07-02 10:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857121, 545834, 74078, '<td valign="top">Love it. I must remember to re-visit the challenge entries after voting is finished so that I can PM you about this image. 9.</td>', 'Love it. I must remember to re-visit the challenge entries after voting is finished so that I can PM you about this image. 9.', '2007-07-02 10:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857129, 546126, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great work and the bright yellow free space is perfect for this shot. If someone asked me what colour might make it better, I would not be able to think of one. Perfect work 10</td>', 'Great work and the bright yellow free space is perfect for this shot. If someone asked me what colour might make it better, I would not be able to think of one. Perfect work 10', '2007-07-02 10:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857141, 545335, 74078, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. Very crisp shot and a pity that the visible eye has little light available to highlight it. 10</td>', 'Love this shot. Very crisp shot and a pity that the visible eye has little light available to highlight it. 10', '2007-07-02 10:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857147, 546214, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the bird, but the background blue looks too artificial.</td>', 'Nice capture of the bird, but the background blue looks too artificial.', '2007-07-02 10:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857152, 546180, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the tiger''s tongue, but the whole picture needs to be a little brighter.</td>', 'Nice capture of the tiger''s tongue, but the whole picture needs to be a little brighter.', '2007-07-02 10:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857161, 535639, 35545, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but those wires.....</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but those wires.....', '2007-07-02 10:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857163, 543740, 35545, '<td valign="top">A little too mysterious.</td>', 'A little too mysterious.', '2007-07-02 10:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857169, 543106, 35545, '<td valign="top">I like the fuzzy processing, but the reds look artificial.</td>', 'I like the fuzzy processing, but the reds look artificial.', '2007-07-02 10:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857184, 545502, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice ocean capture, but IMNSHO, you''ve gone overboard with the processing and colors.  Needs to look a little more natural.</td>', 'Nice ocean capture, but IMNSHO, you''ve gone overboard with the processing and colors.  Needs to look a little more natural.', '2007-07-02 10:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857193, 540928, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great work.</td>', 'Great work.', '2007-07-02 10:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857199, 545631, 74078, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. Looks plastecine. 10</td>', 'This is amazing. Looks plastecine. 10', '2007-07-02 10:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857200, 545582, 35545, '<td valign="top">I love those ghostly figures on the shore.  If it were my shot, which it isn''t, I''d have cloned out that pole (?) between the shore and the rock jetty.  Otherwise, a very nice b&amp;w.</td>', 'I love those ghostly figures on the shore.  If it were my shot, which it isn''t, I''d have cloned out that pole (?) between the shore and the rock jetty.  Otherwise, a very nice b&w.', '2007-07-02 10:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857204, 542604, 35545, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, but you need to back off on the processing.</td>', 'Clever idea, but you need to back off on the processing.', '2007-07-02 10:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857212, 541308, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice action capture, but a messy background.</td>', 'Nice action capture, but a messy background.', '2007-07-02 10:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857223, 545895, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I''d rather have the thimble in focus rather than the head of the pin.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I''d rather have the thimble in focus rather than the head of the pin.', '2007-07-02 10:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857239, 542023, 35545, '<td valign="top">Need to crop some off the top.</td>', 'Need to crop some off the top.', '2007-07-02 10:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857256, 535599, 35545, '<td valign="top">It looks as if there''s a dead leaf in the lower right.  It detracts from an otherwise wonderful shot.</td>', 'It looks as if there''s a dead leaf in the lower right.  It detracts from an otherwise wonderful shot.', '2007-07-02 10:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857262, 542913, 35545, '<td valign="top">Focus needs to be crisper and a tighter crop.  The empty space at the top doesn''t add anything.  Also, a bit more light on the blue space at the bottom to give a bit of definition.  This shot has a lot of potential.</td>', 'Focus needs to be crisper and a tighter crop.  The empty space at the top doesn''t add anything.  Also, a bit more light on the blue space at the bottom to give a bit of definition.  This shot has a lot of potential.', '2007-07-02 10:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857263, 546158, 35545, '<td valign="top">Too much blue.</td>', 'Too much blue.', '2007-07-02 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857282, 546166, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but background is too busy.  The plane is lost.</td>', 'Good idea, but background is too busy.  The plane is lost.', '2007-07-02 10:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857286, 545949, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs more light.</td>', 'Needs more light.', '2007-07-02 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857290, 533651, 35545, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.</td>', 'Out of focus.', '2007-07-02 10:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857306, 546211, 35545, '<td valign="top">Could do with a closer crop.</td>', 'Could do with a closer crop.', '2007-07-02 10:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857329, 544827, 35545, '<td valign="top">Could do with a closer crop -- get rid of some of the dead foliage at the lower right.</td>', 'Could do with a closer crop -- get rid of some of the dead foliage at the lower right.', '2007-07-02 10:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857340, 533584, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice processing, but the border doesn''t add anything.  Also, I''d get rid of the bobby pin and the stray hair going to the upper right -- they come across as antennae.</td>', 'Nice processing, but the border doesn''t add anything.  Also, I''d get rid of the bobby pin and the stray hair going to the upper right -- they come across as antennae.', '2007-07-02 10:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857347, 545457, 35545, '<td valign="top">That highlight on his left hand really jumps out and distracts from the rest of the image.</td>', 'That highlight on his left hand really jumps out and distracts from the rest of the image.', '2007-07-02 10:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857351, 526146, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice capture -- we seldom see these in the air.</td>', 'Nice capture -- we seldom see these in the air.', '2007-07-02 10:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857422, 546230, 69368, '<td valign="top">really nice seascape!  stairs makes it much more interesting. Clarity shot, great colors! - 8 -</td>', 'really nice seascape!  stairs makes it much more interesting. Clarity shot, great colors! - 8 -', '2007-07-02 11:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857433, 543320, 69368, '<td valign="top">great captured! Great details! Great pic! Like to see it in the Top 5!</td>', 'great captured! Great details! Great pic! Like to see it in the Top 5!', '2007-07-02 11:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857452, 540473, 69368, '<td valign="top">nice picture, I would''ve liked it to have been a little sharper though</td>', 'nice picture, I would''ve liked it to have been a little sharper though', '2007-07-02 11:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857460, 545576, 69368, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s really beautiful! Love the soft colors. Also good lighting.</td>', 'Yes, it''s really beautiful! Love the soft colors. Also good lighting.', '2007-07-02 11:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857510, 546224, 68956, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, shame ZZ''s ear tips got cropped :(  Good DOF.</td>', 'Very sweet, shame ZZ''s ear tips got cropped :(  Good DOF.', '2007-07-02 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857514, 546193, 68956, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, would have been even better if there was some detail in the eye although I appreciate it''s not that easy.</td>', 'Lovely shot, would have been even better if there was some detail in the eye although I appreciate it''s not that easy.', '2007-07-02 11:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857521, 546230, 68956, '<td valign="top">A lovely calm shot with a nice bit of foreground interest leading you in.</td>', 'A lovely calm shot with a nice bit of foreground interest leading you in.', '2007-07-02 11:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857527, 546166, 68956, '<td valign="top">A picture telling a story. It would have been great if the plane had cleared the background mountains, but still a good shot.:)</td>', 'A picture telling a story. It would have been great if the plane had cleared the background mountains, but still a good shot.:)', '2007-07-02 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857532, 546201, 68956, '<td valign="top">Good expression and composition, just slightly soft with the eye focus.</td>', 'Good expression and composition, just slightly soft with the eye focus.', '2007-07-02 11:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857546, 544412, 31829, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but you went overboard with the saturation.</td>', 'Nice scene, but you went overboard with the saturation.', '2007-07-02 11:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857550, 540787, 68956, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, just can''t get along with the thing by her mouth.</td>', 'This is lovely, just can''t get along with the thing by her mouth.', '2007-07-02 11:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857572, 543950, 31829, '<td valign="top">humm...</td>', 'humm...', '2007-07-02 11:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857587, 528711, 68956, '<td valign="top">Looks a wonderful dog, very oversharpened unfortunately. :)</td>', 'Looks a wonderful dog, very oversharpened unfortunately. :)', '2007-07-02 11:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857610, 545581, 31829, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice scene, but oversharpened.', '2007-07-02 12:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857629, 532126, 31829, '<td valign="top">Your processing makes the sky look fake here.</td>', 'Your processing makes the sky look fake here.', '2007-07-02 12:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857655, 536676, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture with excellent composition.  My complements to you and the model.  Three suggestions; the reflections are too harsh, causing the tummy, chest and forehead to blend into the white background; a little fill light on the side of the head and hair would help; and the expressions looks a little posed, like she''s been holding that position for some time rather than a spontaneous glance up with more expression, though I suppose a prolonged look matches the title better.  Still, I''ll give it an 8.</td>', 'Beautiful picture with excellent composition.  My complements to you and the model.  Three suggestions; the reflections are too harsh, causing the tummy, chest and forehead to blend into the white background; a little fill light on the side of the head and hair would help; and the expressions looks a little posed, like she''s been holding that position for some time rather than a spontaneous glance up with more expression, though I suppose a prolonged look matches the title better.  Still, I''ll give it an 8.', '2007-07-02 12:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857670, 545704, 76430, '<td valign="top">The object you (supposedly) have the most control over, the person, looks strangely detached from the scene, twisted and looking out of picture, and the arms look shortened.  Otherwise, lovely picture.  Good placement of the leafy branch not as a frame, but as a prominent part of the picture adding depth.</td>', 'The object you (supposedly) have the most control over, the person, looks strangely detached from the scene, twisted and looking out of picture, and the arms look shortened.  Otherwise, lovely picture.  Good placement of the leafy branch not as a frame, but as a prominent part of the picture adding depth.', '2007-07-02 12:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857681, 545893, 76430, '<td valign="top">Too contrasty and washed out.  She looks angry.</td>', 'Too contrasty and washed out.  She looks angry.', '2007-07-02 12:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857692, 540272, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good vertical placement of poles, lighthouse and portrait shot.  I''d recommend cropping the top, left and bottom to bring out the subject more and remove unneeded parts like the sky, antenna and front of the rocks as well as moving the subject from dead center.</td>', 'Good vertical placement of poles, lighthouse and portrait shot.  I''d recommend cropping the top, left and bottom to bring out the subject more and remove unneeded parts like the sky, antenna and front of the rocks as well as moving the subject from dead center.', '2007-07-02 12:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857724, 546176, 76430, '<td valign="top">All of the lines and kitchen utinsels really detract from an otherwise creative and interesting shot.  The ceramic cat appears to be watching the clouds that we see in reflection.  The reflection lighting could stand some balancing also because too large a dynamic range.</td>', 'All of the lines and kitchen utinsels really detract from an otherwise creative and interesting shot.  The ceramic cat appears to be watching the clouds that we see in reflection.  The reflection lighting could stand some balancing also because too large a dynamic range.', '2007-07-02 12:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857731, 546068, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good timing catching the jockey dead-center in the sign.  I would adjust the brightness down a bit and the color up a bit.</td>', 'Good timing catching the jockey dead-center in the sign.  I would adjust the brightness down a bit and the color up a bit.', '2007-07-02 12:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857800, 546193, 11920, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2007-07-02 13:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857801, 545988, 11920, '<td valign="top">Like this one.</td>', 'Like this one.', '2007-07-02 13:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857804, 544523, 11920, '<td valign="top">Outstanding</td>', 'Outstanding', '2007-07-02 13:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857815, 545244, 11920, '<td valign="top">Great Shot</td>', 'Great Shot', '2007-07-02 13:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857839, 544764, 11920, '<td valign="top">Awsome</td>', 'Awsome', '2007-07-02 13:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857851, 540800, 66635, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!  What a beautiful place!  What a wonderful capture of it!</td>', 'Spectacular!  What a beautiful place!  What a wonderful capture of it!', '2007-07-02 13:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857882, 545754, 66635, '<td valign="top">What an amazing sight!  Wish I''d been there!</td>', 'What an amazing sight!  Wish I''d been there!', '2007-07-02 13:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857892, 546055, 66635, '<td valign="top">Really great!  Love the perspective, the clouds in the blue sky, the shadows and the sun.  Damn good.</td>', 'Really great!  Love the perspective, the clouds in the blue sky, the shadows and the sun.  Damn good.', '2007-07-02 13:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857898, 544741, 66635, '<td valign="top">Awesome depiction of the carefree days of childhood!</td>', 'Awesome depiction of the carefree days of childhood!', '2007-07-02 13:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857903, 536388, 66635, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed.  Great colors.  If you could have gotten a slightly wider DOF to bring the entire blossom into sharp focus, it would have been spectacular.</td>', 'Very nicely composed.  Great colors.  If you could have gotten a slightly wider DOF to bring the entire blossom into sharp focus, it would have been spectacular.', '2007-07-02 13:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3857909, 527752, 66635, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, pespective, foreground interest and colors.  Great job.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, pespective, foreground interest and colors.  Great job.', '2007-07-02 13:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
