(3858716, 541467, 78455, '<td valign="top">Too much clutter and no point of focus has ultimatelly let you down with this image. Next time try to make a single object your point of reference and try to get your image to lead the viewer to it! When you capture an image try to think, ''what am I trying to say with it, what story do I want to tell'' and that way I think you''ll capture much better images.</td>', 'Too much clutter and no point of focus has ultimatelly let you down with this image. Next time try to make a single object your point of reference and try to get your image to lead the viewer to it! When you capture an image try to think, ''what am I trying to say with it, what story do I want to tell'' and that way I think you''ll capture much better images.', '2007-07-02 16:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
