(3859708, 544723, 80278, '<td valign="top">Great job on an often-shot subject. The many subtleties of the capture and of post-processing are fully appreciated on this end. I would give it a 10, but it might go to your head, so given the DPC standard, you should be happy with a 9. Especially since there is a mysterious black speck near the top. Is that a leaper? If it is, deduct a point from the rating for not getting his eye in focus.</td>', 'Great job on an often-shot subject. The many subtleties of the capture and of post-processing are fully appreciated on this end. I would give it a 10, but it might go to your head, so given the DPC standard, you should be happy with a 9. Especially since there is a mysterious black speck near the top. Is that a leaper? If it is, deduct a point from the rating for not getting his eye in focus.', '2007-07-02 18:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
