(3861718, 546113, 64795, '<td valign="top">The subject seems like quite an interesting guy.  I like the high key HDR look.  I also like the colors.</td>', 'The subject seems like quite an interesting guy.  I like the high key HDR look.  I also like the colors.', '2007-07-03 02:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
