(3861725, 545926, 64795, '<td valign="top">Awesome macro.  I only wish that the stick was not so blown out.  The colors are great, and the DOF is perfect.</td>', 'Awesome macro.  I only wish that the stick was not so blown out.  The colors are great, and the DOF is perfect.', '2007-07-03 02:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
