(3861746, 541879, 64795, '<td valign="top">Haha.  I don''t like the background, but I do like the lighting on the white flower.  I would have toned down the yellow saturation a little bit too.</td>', 'Haha.  I don''t like the background, but I do like the lighting on the white flower.  I would have toned down the yellow saturation a little bit too.', '2007-07-03 02:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
