(3861790, 545149, 29269, '<td valign="top">This one looks good. You could have cloned out that crane, I don''t think that you''d be hit with the ''major element'' rule for that one. The Frost tower is just a tad overexposed - I know it''s hard to get the dynamic range right after dark, but with advanced editing, you could have tried to selectively adjust the curves on the tower only.<br/>Good luck! 7.</td>', 'This one looks good. You could have cloned out that crane, I don''t think that you''d be hit with the ''major element'' rule for that one. The Frost tower is just a tad overexposed - I know it''s hard to get the dynamic range right after dark, but with advanced editing, you could have tried to selectively adjust the curves on the tower only.Good luck! 7.', '2007-07-03 02:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
