(3863827, 546094, 28471, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...not sure what you were trying for here but I hope you accomplished it.  Frontal flash in the dark rarely works well and it appears to be slightly out of focus.  Next time try to use a rear curtain sync on your flash if you are trying to be creative.</td>', 'Hmmm...not sure what you were trying for here but I hope you accomplished it.  Frontal flash in the dark rarely works well and it appears to be slightly out of focus.  Next time try to use a rear curtain sync on your flash if you are trying to be creative.', '2007-07-03 17:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
