(3864969, 544468, 28471, '<td valign="top">Lots of flies in this challenge - insect of the month?  Anyway good sharp focus...maybe a little too sharp as I can see evidence of over sharpening around the feet of the fly.  Other than that excellent photo.</td>', 'Lots of flies in this challenge - insect of the month?  Anyway good sharp focus...maybe a little too sharp as I can see evidence of over sharpening around the feet of the fly.  Other than that excellent photo.', '2007-07-03 23:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
