(3864988, 545892, 28471, '<td valign="top">Great photo compositionally.  I think most people have a tendency to over saturate their greens in post process and I see no exception to that in this photo.  A little more subtle color boost in the green would have made this a more natural - i.e. less processed - looking photo.</td>', 'Great photo compositionally.  I think most people have a tendency to over saturate their greens in post process and I see no exception to that in this photo.  A little more subtle color boost in the green would have made this a more natural - i.e. less processed - looking photo.', '2007-07-03 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3864993, 543549, 28471, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  Her expression is great.  A tighter crop would have been nice.  Her left hand also appears to be in an unnatural position.  She has a greenish cast on her skin.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  Her expression is great.  A tighter crop would have been nice.  Her left hand also appears to be in an unnatural position.  She has a greenish cast on her skin.', '2007-07-03 23:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
