(3864999, 546181, 28471, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus in this photo.  Normally not a good idea for a macro but you obviously know what you are doing.  Works well here with the soft yellow colors.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the soft focus in this photo.  Normally not a good idea for a macro but you obviously know what you are doing.  Works well here with the soft yellow colors.  Good job.', '2007-07-03 23:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3865005, 545060, 28471, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like flower photos and in this none have proven to be an exception to that expect for this photo.  Good job on photographing a common subject and adding interest.  I love the colors, strong leading lines, and diagonals in this photo.  Well done.</td>', 'I usually don''t like flower photos and in this none have proven to be an exception to that expect for this photo.  Good job on photographing a common subject and adding interest.  I love the colors, strong leading lines, and diagonals in this photo.  Well done.', '2007-07-03 23:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
