(3865781, 544313, 19708, '<td valign="top">OK, I recognize her, and I must say, this is a much nicer pose for her facial shape. Gorgeous eyes - wow!<br/>Cropping a little tighter off the top certainly wouldn''t have hurt this.<br/>Now all we need is a smile!</td>', 'OK, I recognize her, and I must say, this is a much nicer pose for her facial shape. Gorgeous eyes - wow!Cropping a little tighter off the top certainly wouldn''t have hurt this.Now all we need is a smile!', '2007-07-04 03:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
