(3867454, 545366, 31403, '<td valign="top">I find myself wondering - what is this a photo of?<br/> <br/>Cool lighting - nope<br/>Cool colors - nope<br/>Really calm - nope (lots of ripples in the water)<br/>Excellent subject - not that I can see<br/> <br/>That is very direct feedback - but I wanted you to know why I gave this a low score.  I hope that''s helpful on some level.</td>', 'I find myself wondering - what is this a photo of? Cool lighting - nopeCool colors - nopeReally calm - nope (lots of ripples in the water)Excellent subject - not that I can see That is very direct feedback - but I wanted you to know why I gave this a low score.  I hope that''s helpful on some level.', '2007-07-04 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3867480, 545886, 15711, '<td valign="top">The lighting is phenomenal.  Gorgeous. I love the tucks and folds of her gown. Oftentimes that can be a detraction, but in this case it really adds to the allure of the shot.</td>', 'The lighting is phenomenal.  Gorgeous. I love the tucks and folds of her gown. Oftentimes that can be a detraction, but in this case it really adds to the allure of the shot.', '2007-07-04 13:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
