(3868386, 543759, 57882, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular.  The lighting is so dramatic, and well matched to the subject.  Best one so far.</td>', 'This is spectacular.  The lighting is so dramatic, and well matched to the subject.  Best one so far.', '2007-07-04 17:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
