(3868571, 535599, 51802, '<td valign="top">An wonderful photo that would be perfect except for one very minor thing.  The dust in the top right is very distracting.  You are allowed to remove that under this rule set.</td>', 'An wonderful photo that would be perfect except for one very minor thing.  The dust in the top right is very distracting.  You are allowed to remove that under this rule set.', '2007-07-04 18:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
