(3868581, 535008, 51802, '<td valign="top">The lighting really hurts this shot, and it would be much better if you had the rabbit''s face included as well.</td>', 'The lighting really hurts this shot, and it would be much better if you had the rabbit''s face included as well.', '2007-07-04 18:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
