(3868620, 545590, 51802, '<td valign="top">This is wicked cool!  I could see this being an advertisement for this car.</td>', 'This is wicked cool!  I could see this being an advertisement for this car.', '2007-07-04 18:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868627, 533545, 51802, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.  I like how you can see inside the nest.</td>', 'Nice close up.  I like how you can see inside the nest.', '2007-07-04 18:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868635, 546049, 51802, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing!  I like how you rotated this shot.</td>', 'Perfect timing!  I like how you rotated this shot.', '2007-07-04 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868640, 542604, 51802, '<td valign="top">Interesting still life.  It might be better if the DoF were more shallow so that the grass were even more out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting still life.  It might be better if the DoF were more shallow so that the grass were even more out of focus.', '2007-07-04 18:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868653, 543023, 51802, '<td valign="top">I like the different blues here, also good use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'I like the different blues here, also good use of the rule of thirds.', '2007-07-04 18:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868654, 545949, 51802, '<td valign="top">What would really improve this would be if there were a person about 3/4 the way back, looking toward the sunset.  This just feels a little too empty for me.</td>', 'What would really improve this would be if there were a person about 3/4 the way back, looking toward the sunset.  This just feels a little too empty for me.', '2007-07-04 19:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868679, 544856, 51802, '<td valign="top">I think they knew you were taking their picture and posed just right for this shot!  :-)</td>', 'I think they knew you were taking their picture and posed just right for this shot!  :-)', '2007-07-04 19:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868686, 531261, 51802, '<td valign="top">There is an uneasiness in the composition here.  I think it would have worked better if you had cropped in tighter so that the rider was not visible, or made this a wider shot so that you could see more of him.</td>', 'There is an uneasiness in the composition here.  I think it would have worked better if you had cropped in tighter so that the rider was not visible, or made this a wider shot so that you could see more of him.', '2007-07-04 19:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868688, 537062, 51802, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the processing.  I would really like to learn this technique.</td>', 'Nice job on the processing.  I would really like to learn this technique.', '2007-07-04 19:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868701, 544319, 51802, '<td valign="top">Until I looked at the title, I could not figure out what I was looking at.  Nice close up.</td>', 'Until I looked at the title, I could not figure out what I was looking at.  Nice close up.', '2007-07-04 19:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868709, 545603, 51802, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing her reflection.</td>', 'Great job capturing her reflection.', '2007-07-04 19:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868714, 536676, 51802, '<td valign="top">A wonderful portrait and the lighting is perfect.</td>', 'A wonderful portrait and the lighting is perfect.', '2007-07-04 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868729, 527906, 51802, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  Was this a double exposure?</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  Was this a double exposure?', '2007-07-04 19:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868743, 541812, 51802, '<td valign="top">The lighting made the shot.  Well done.</td>', 'The lighting made the shot.  Well done.', '2007-07-04 19:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868806, 546207, 15407, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping &amp; composure. The desaturated background works well and makes this POP.  What I like the most is how well the title is represented in the focus of his eyes. I also found it interesting that his visor is noticeably cleaner than the fairing &amp; windshield. Likely a combination of staying tucked in low or using a lot of tear offs.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-08 00:57:40.</i></td>', 'I like the cropping & composure. The desaturated background works well and makes this POP.  What I like the most is how well the title is represented in the focus of his eyes. I also found it interesting that his visor is noticeably cleaner than the fairing & windshield. Likely a combination of staying tucked in low or using a lot of tear offs.', '2007-07-04 19:28:38.000000', '2007-07-08 01:57:40.000000', 1),
(3868834, 544888, 51802, '<td valign="top">Boosting the saturation might help the colors.  They appear washed out.</td>', 'Boosting the saturation might help the colors.  They appear washed out.', '2007-07-04 19:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868836, 546113, 51802, '<td valign="top">Cool portrait.  I like the processing you did.</td>', 'Cool portrait.  I like the processing you did.', '2007-07-04 19:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868837, 546138, 51802, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and good use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Lovely colors and good use of the rule of thirds.', '2007-07-04 19:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868841, 543847, 51802, '<td valign="top">Nice candid portrait.  I like how her hair is in her face.</td>', 'Nice candid portrait.  I like how her hair is in her face.', '2007-07-04 19:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868848, 543085, 51802, '<td valign="top">It would be nice if the silhouette were sharper, also some noise reduction would help.</td>', 'It would be nice if the silhouette were sharper, also some noise reduction would help.', '2007-07-04 19:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868857, 546203, 78229, '<td valign="top">water looks a little too sharp for my liking but good shot! 7</td>', 'water looks a little too sharp for my liking but good shot! 7', '2007-07-04 19:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868881, 546118, 51802, '<td valign="top">The swan posed perfectly for you!</td>', 'The swan posed perfectly for you!', '2007-07-04 19:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868885, 536677, 51802, '<td valign="top">It looks like he is wondering what you are doing!</td>', 'It looks like he is wondering what you are doing!', '2007-07-04 19:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868888, 539248, 51802, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful job with this.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful job with this.', '2007-07-04 19:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868889, 545121, 51802, '<td valign="top">Good job on her eyes, and the soft focus works well here.</td>', 'Good job on her eyes, and the soft focus works well here.', '2007-07-04 19:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3868896, 545872, 51802, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and a good job on the B&amp;W treatment</td>', 'Nice portrait and a good job on the B&W treatment', '2007-07-04 19:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869038, 540295, 70000, '<td valign="top">i don''t get the composition here, the depth of field doesn''t really do much for the photo and it doesn''t seem to have a strong direction</td>', 'i don''t get the composition here, the depth of field doesn''t really do much for the photo and it doesn''t seem to have a strong direction', '2007-07-04 20:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869097, 545103, 51802, '<td valign="top">Wonderful processing.  I especially like the effect you created with the sky.</td>', 'Wonderful processing.  I especially like the effect you created with the sky.', '2007-07-04 21:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869106, 544514, 51802, '<td valign="top">I think this may be more dramatic if the person on the right were not in the photo.  He is such a dark element in this otherwise light picture, that he steals the attention of your eye.</td>', 'I think this may be more dramatic if the person on the right were not in the photo.  He is such a dark element in this otherwise light picture, that he steals the attention of your eye.', '2007-07-04 21:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869124, 544108, 51802, '<td valign="top">A lovely place to watch the sun set.</td>', 'A lovely place to watch the sun set.', '2007-07-04 21:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869127, 543259, 76430, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I know I just read the photographer''s comments on this one yesterday, like you were laying on your back and this lighthouse is only 20 feet tall.  Anyway, nice picture.  Good POV, coloring, detail, and the clouds that look like an aerial view of an ice flow or something.</td>', 'Hmmm...I know I just read the photographer''s comments on this one yesterday, like you were laying on your back and this lighthouse is only 20 feet tall.  Anyway, nice picture.  Good POV, coloring, detail, and the clouds that look like an aerial view of an ice flow or something.', '2007-07-04 21:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869137, 545558, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and positioning.</td>', 'Good DOF and positioning.', '2007-07-04 21:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869150, 545438, 2158, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully expressive image.  The depth of field is perfect to make those eyes really stand out.</td>', 'What a wonderfully expressive image.  The depth of field is perfect to make those eyes really stand out.', '2007-07-04 21:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869154, 546049, 76430, '<td valign="top">Effective tilt on the Thunderbirds picture makes it more interesting than the original horizontal.</td>', 'Effective tilt on the Thunderbirds picture makes it more interesting than the original horizontal.', '2007-07-04 21:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869158, 542355, 51802, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective shot.  A great opportunity to find two cars like this!</td>', 'Nice perspective shot.  A great opportunity to find two cars like this!', '2007-07-04 21:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869161, 541871, 51802, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic!  You used the lighting well.</td>', 'Very dramatic!  You used the lighting well.', '2007-07-04 21:27:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3869168, 543675, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good exposure.  I think a faster shutter speed would have helped.  Maybe also better timing to prevent the nearby pole from getting in front of the structure.</td>', 'Good exposure.  I think a faster shutter speed would have helped.  Maybe also better timing to prevent the nearby pole from getting in front of the structure.', '2007-07-04 21:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869169, 546210, 51802, '<td valign="top">Good job on this!  The lighting is usually pretty bad in aquariums, but you captured this very well.</td>', 'Good job on this!  The lighting is usually pretty bad in aquariums, but you captured this very well.', '2007-07-04 21:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869174, 544523, 51802, '<td valign="top">This would make a wonderful postcard.</td>', 'This would make a wonderful postcard.', '2007-07-04 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869177, 541796, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent altered mirror effect between the sides.  Good costumes and expressions.  This must have been at some event rather than going to all the trouble of putting this all together for this picture.  Good shot.</td>', 'Excellent altered mirror effect between the sides.  Good costumes and expressions.  This must have been at some event rather than going to all the trouble of putting this all together for this picture.  Good shot.', '2007-07-04 21:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869178, 546068, 51802, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing! I am always amazed when I see horses "in flight" like this.</td>', 'Perfect timing! I am always amazed when I see horses "in flight" like this.', '2007-07-04 21:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869186, 542070, 51802, '<td valign="top">I usually hate shots with woodys in them, but this one is nice.</td>', 'I usually hate shots with woodys in them, but this one is nice.', '2007-07-04 21:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869189, 546055, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry, sun on the top center, clouds, and scene.</td>', 'Good symmetry, sun on the top center, clouds, and scene.', '2007-07-04 21:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869204, 527752, 76430, '<td valign="top">The horizon appears tilted, but it works in this one.  Nice coloring and detail.</td>', 'The horizon appears tilted, but it works in this one.  Nice coloring and detail.', '2007-07-04 21:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869225, 544794, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good selective desaturation.  Nice scene.  I''d like to see more faces.</td>', 'Good selective desaturation.  Nice scene.  I''d like to see more faces.', '2007-07-04 21:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
