(3869644, 539620, 76430, '<td valign="top">This can''t be trevytrev, unless it''s a 5 year old picture, though it looks like his portrait.  Nice shot.  Decent lighting, except for shadows behind Trevor''s head and arm, glare on forehead, and somewhat over-bright on other skin.  Good composition and pose timing.</td>', 'This can''t be trevytrev, unless it''s a 5 year old picture, though it looks like his portrait.  Nice shot.  Decent lighting, except for shadows behind Trevor''s head and arm, glare on forehead, and somewhat over-bright on other skin.  Good composition and pose timing.', '2007-07-05 00:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
