(3869813, 544485, 70000, '<td valign="top">what an adorable and natural moment, i love the texture on the wall and how it contrasts with the texture of the skin clothing and hair. beautiful shot</td>', 'what an adorable and natural moment, i love the texture on the wall and how it contrasts with the texture of the skin clothing and hair. beautiful shot', '2007-07-05 01:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869871, 533218, 76430, '<td valign="top">If you used a fast shutter it would freeze motion, but would not show raw energy.  If you used a very slow shutter it would be more of a soft billow, also not indicating raw energy.  With a middle-speed shutter the motion and power can be seen.  Unfortunately at first it looks like it''s blurred, but the steady rocks show it''s not.</td>', 'If you used a fast shutter it would freeze motion, but would not show raw energy.  If you used a very slow shutter it would be more of a soft billow, also not indicating raw energy.  With a middle-speed shutter the motion and power can be seen.  Unfortunately at first it looks like it''s blurred, but the steady rocks show it''s not.', '2007-07-05 01:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3869882, 529690, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp picture of the monkey, and good bokeh background.</td>', 'Nice sharp picture of the monkey, and good bokeh background.', '2007-07-05 02:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
