(3869920, 545324, 76430, '<td valign="top">Pet pictures are usually risky here, but you did well on this one.  The head is in good focus, but everything else blends into the unusual "snowstorm" background.  Well done.</td>', 'Pet pictures are usually risky here, but you did well on this one.  The head is in good focus, but everything else blends into the unusual "snowstorm" background.  Well done.', '2007-07-05 02:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
