(3871175, 546173, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalism here. The only qualm I have is that I know the mood is false, I cannot relate it to a fellow in the park doing a crossword puzzle. Still, it''s a pleasure for me as a viewer to "puzzle" out this photo. 8</td>', 'I like the minimalism here. The only qualm I have is that I know the mood is false, I cannot relate it to a fellow in the park doing a crossword puzzle. Still, it''s a pleasure for me as a viewer to "puzzle" out this photo. 8', '2007-07-05 12:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
