(3871233, 545498, 50695, '<td valign="top">remarkable webbing.</td>', 'remarkable webbing.', '2007-07-05 12:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871248, 544409, 70000, '<td valign="top">wonderful black and white portrait, the placement in the frame is a little odd, its not quite centere but not quite rule of thirds, strange, but i love the depth of field and the bw conversion was done beautifully, great textures as well</td>', 'wonderful black and white portrait, the placement in the frame is a little odd, its not quite centere but not quite rule of thirds, strange, but i love the depth of field and the bw conversion was done beautifully, great textures as well', '2007-07-05 12:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871262, 542977, 50695, '<td valign="top">Not the most exciting scene but you captured all of its significance. Most of all, your angle is perfect, but also the exposure, the way the guy on the right disappears into shadow, the way the burden is underscored with sharp, dark shadows. Your composition captures the graceful curve of draining water interacting in an interesting way with the two men. Also, a strongly diagonaly composition adds energy. I''m not sure if the line across the bottom helps, but it doesn''t seem to hurt, either. One doesn''t mind a horizontal on the bottom helping to frame things a bit. A fascinating geometry here, phasing back and forth between two dimensions and three, where "down" is the same for both.</td>', 'Not the most exciting scene but you captured all of its significance. Most of all, your angle is perfect, but also the exposure, the way the guy on the right disappears into shadow, the way the burden is underscored with sharp, dark shadows. Your composition captures the graceful curve of draining water interacting in an interesting way with the two men. Also, a strongly diagonaly composition adds energy. I''m not sure if the line across the bottom helps, but it doesn''t seem to hurt, either. One doesn''t mind a horizontal on the bottom helping to frame things a bit. A fascinating geometry here, phasing back and forth between two dimensions and three, where "down" is the same for both.', '2007-07-05 13:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871275, 544418, 50695, '<td valign="top">This leopard looks like a professional model. Nice texture on the tree and lovely background bokeh as well.</td>', 'This leopard looks like a professional model. Nice texture on the tree and lovely background bokeh as well.', '2007-07-05 13:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871281, 546126, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is HILARIOUS!!! Wonderful! I love the simplicity and the colors and composition, just great</td>', 'This is HILARIOUS!!! Wonderful! I love the simplicity and the colors and composition, just great', '2007-07-05 13:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871282, 543794, 50695, '<td valign="top">The deer is a nice foil for the real subject of this photo. Those gorgeous flowers and trees. I also like the squares within squares composition.</td>', 'The deer is a nice foil for the real subject of this photo. Those gorgeous flowers and trees. I also like the squares within squares composition.', '2007-07-05 13:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871286, 545104, 70000, '<td valign="top">very interesting choice of lighting, i love the mystery of not being able to see his eyes</td>', 'very interesting choice of lighting, i love the mystery of not being able to see his eyes', '2007-07-05 13:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871320, 526273, 50695, '<td valign="top">Fascinating. I''m eager to find out what this is. An art installation? Or did you just turn it into that with your camera? A truly arresting image.</td>', 'Fascinating. I''m eager to find out what this is. An art installation? Or did you just turn it into that with your camera? A truly arresting image.', '2007-07-05 13:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871334, 541357, 50695, '<td valign="top">when you get too close to someone, you can''t see them properly and yet you feel you are seeing them more intimately. You have conveyed this intimacy perfectly, and allowed just enough clarity for us to feel like we know and love these people.</td>', 'when you get too close to someone, you can''t see them properly and yet you feel you are seeing them more intimately. You have conveyed this intimacy perfectly, and allowed just enough clarity for us to feel like we know and love these people.', '2007-07-05 13:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871356, 531261, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like this crop, with the man''s forelimbs and the horse''s forelimbs, each of them conveying their own body language. But the language you''re talking about can be seen between the hand and the horse''s nose. It is the language of obedience, and I can see the tension of this horse who knows what it means but does not want to know what it means, who would like to forget but is on the verge of acceptance.</td>', 'I like this crop, with the man''s forelimbs and the horse''s forelimbs, each of them conveying their own body language. But the language you''re talking about can be seen between the hand and the horse''s nose. It is the language of obedience, and I can see the tension of this horse who knows what it means but does not want to know what it means, who would like to forget but is on the verge of acceptance.', '2007-07-05 13:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871358, 543570, 42100, '<td valign="top">That''s some very nice light...it really compliments that ornate church well.  The bell(?) smack in the middle kind of bugs me, but I really like the photo as whole.  Great job!</td>', 'That''s some very nice light...it really compliments that ornate church well.  The bell(?) smack in the middle kind of bugs me, but I really like the photo as whole.  Great job!', '2007-07-05 13:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
