(3871664, 545556, 80104, '<td valign="top">very nice... too bad the foliage above the falls wasn''t more in focus or I guess less soft... might have helped on the emphasis of the beauty within the falls.  Kind of like a natural border around the top edge to put focus on the rest of the picture</td>', 'very nice... too bad the foliage above the falls wasn''t more in focus or I guess less soft... might have helped on the emphasis of the beauty within the falls.  Kind of like a natural border around the top edge to put focus on the rest of the picture', '2007-07-05 14:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871667, 546127, 80104, '<td valign="top">Very nice work on the pool of water... very nice work.</td>', 'Very nice work on the pool of water... very nice work.', '2007-07-05 14:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871671, 545240, 80104, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like this photo much... The background seems lacking for a portrait shot and I believe the photo could have used a tad of softness.</td>', 'I don''t really like this photo much... The background seems lacking for a portrait shot and I believe the photo could have used a tad of softness.', '2007-07-05 14:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
