(3871684, 544497, 80104, '<td valign="top">Nice try but it feels a little noisy in terms of the grass.  Also why didn''t you clone out the dark spots...  That would help.  My eyes can''t help but be attracted to look at those spots.</td>', 'Nice try but it feels a little noisy in terms of the grass.  Also why didn''t you clone out the dark spots...  That would help.  My eyes can''t help but be attracted to look at those spots.', '2007-07-05 14:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
