(3871823, 543690, 70000, '<td valign="top">What an odd photograph, everyhting is colored very  natural and then there is a random nion green stick, the arch of his back looks kind of unstable to me, not as strong as an athlete would normally appear to be. the artificial lighting gives him a sort of godly air though, interesting photo, great sky and good composition</td>', 'What an odd photograph, everyhting is colored very  natural and then there is a random nion green stick, the arch of his back looks kind of unstable to me, not as strong as an athlete would normally appear to be. the artificial lighting gives him a sort of godly air though, interesting photo, great sky and good composition', '2007-07-05 15:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3871826, 535640, 70514, '<td valign="top">Angelic...</td>', 'Angelic...', '2007-07-05 15:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
