(3872937, 536676, 70000, '<td valign="top">magnificent lighting! been done before, classic maternity shot, but the direction the woman is looking...away from her child and into the air, very uplifting, its not as down and heavy as many maternity shots i have seen, the way she is holding the cloth on her chest seems a little stiff/forced, but the lighitng on her face and her expression are MAGICAL</td>', 'magnificent lighting! been done before, classic maternity shot, but the direction the woman is looking...away from her child and into the air, very uplifting, its not as down and heavy as many maternity shots i have seen, the way she is holding the cloth on her chest seems a little stiff/forced, but the lighitng on her face and her expression are MAGICAL', '2007-07-05 19:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
