(3873438, 526146, 62187, '<td valign="top">It looks like your getting a little achromatic aberrations (purple fringing) with your lens - I get it too especially with long shots. I''ve noticed if I turn down the magentas it makes it go away mostly. Also, it looks a little over sharpened especially along the branch. It''s a nice capture and good timing. Hey wait, I just realized I have a photo with the same name: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=459268" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/615/thumb/459268.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/615/thumb/459268.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/615/thumb/459268.jpg"/></a>. Just a different kind of bird! Good luck to ya!</td>', 'It looks like your getting a little achromatic aberrations (purple fringing) with your lens - I get it too especially with long shots. I''ve noticed if I turn down the magentas it makes it go away mostly. Also, it looks a little over sharpened especially along the branch. It''s a nice capture and good timing. Hey wait, I just realized I have a photo with the same name: . Just a different kind of bird! Good luck to ya!', '2007-07-05 21:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
