(3876999, 544316, 51802, '<td valign="top">The shadows make it look like the footsteps are raised above the surface instead of pressed below it.  Very unique.</td>', 'The shadows make it look like the footsteps are raised above the surface instead of pressed below it.  Very unique.', '2007-07-06 23:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877013, 544316, 50695, '<td valign="top">You perfected the concave/convex illusion here, creating something rock-solid permanent from something completely ephemeral. The well-balanced composition completes this effect to create something not only permanent, but classic.</td>', 'You perfected the concave/convex illusion here, creating something rock-solid permanent from something completely ephemeral. The well-balanced composition completes this effect to create something not only permanent, but classic.', '2007-07-06 23:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877014, 545274, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love these little warriors, and I love the mysterious background even more.</td>', 'I love these little warriors, and I love the mysterious background even more.', '2007-07-06 23:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877016, 546094, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t know this person but my guess is he''s rather eccentric and your photo is just as eccentric as he is. I love the darkness and the limbs of various species reaching out into it. I love his sad-happy smile. I love his dancer''s pose. And of course the glasses, which somehow pull it all together (along with the green bowtie, of course).</td>', 'I don''t know this person but my guess is he''s rather eccentric and your photo is just as eccentric as he is. I love the darkness and the limbs of various species reaching out into it. I love his sad-happy smile. I love his dancer''s pose. And of course the glasses, which somehow pull it all together (along with the green bowtie, of course).', '2007-07-06 23:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877017, 542757, 50695, '<td valign="top">this photo has secret birds and the four compartments of the heart. Instant 10.</td>', 'this photo has secret birds and the four compartments of the heart. Instant 10.', '2007-07-06 23:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877018, 530706, 50695, '<td valign="top">Every once in a while I see a picture that looks like it''s been encoded by aliens trying to get a secret message to me past Homeland Security. I respond by scoring 10. Then I await further instructions.</td>', 'Every once in a while I see a picture that looks like it''s been encoded by aliens trying to get a secret message to me past Homeland Security. I respond by scoring 10. Then I await further instructions.', '2007-07-06 23:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877020, 546176, 50695, '<td valign="top">A cat makes the world by seeing it, he makes the cat by making her, you make the cat by taking her, I make the cat by looking at her, and with her the clouds of her world.</td>', 'A cat makes the world by seeing it, he makes the cat by making her, you make the cat by taking her, I make the cat by looking at her, and with her the clouds of her world.', '2007-07-06 23:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877021, 545514, 50695, '<td valign="top">Perfect title. and the DOF makes this their world, radiating out from them.</td>', 'Perfect title. and the DOF makes this their world, radiating out from them.', '2007-07-06 23:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877022, 546222, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the impossible shape of the boy. The man who stands there seems there solely to keep the universe from falling apart in the wedge of this boy''s mad energy.</td>', 'I love the impossible shape of the boy. The man who stands there seems there solely to keep the universe from falling apart in the wedge of this boy''s mad energy.', '2007-07-06 23:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877023, 536463, 50695, '<td valign="top">A perfect setting. As mysterious it is, I am well placed. I see the opening to the hall, the door to the bedroom. He is in a public living room or foyer. He is reflecting a painting he doesn''t even understand. I am amazed and impressed at just how much story you''ve packed into a single image.</td>', 'A perfect setting. As mysterious it is, I am well placed. I see the opening to the hall, the door to the bedroom. He is in a public living room or foyer. He is reflecting a painting he doesn''t even understand. I am amazed and impressed at just how much story you''ve packed into a single image.', '2007-07-06 23:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3877030, 545905, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is indeed the decisive moment, when each body is in perfect position in relation to each other and in relation to its phase of entry through the wall of water. It is a simple perfection of a photo.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is indeed the decisive moment, when each body is in perfect position in relation to each other and in relation to its phase of entry through the wall of water. It is a simple perfection of a photo. Posthumous Blue Ribbon', '2007-07-06 23:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
