(3878149, 544307, 41794, '<td valign="top">Great sense of flow in the water and erosion on the rocks. I also like how you lined up (Intentionally?) the other rock jutting out from the water through the arch.</td>', 'Great sense of flow in the water and erosion on the rocks. I also like how you lined up (Intentionally?) the other rock jutting out from the water through the arch.', '2007-07-07 12:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878150, 546230, 41794, '<td valign="top">Nice calm pastel colors and the way the deck leads on to the beach is perfect.</td>', 'Nice calm pastel colors and the way the deck leads on to the beach is perfect.', '2007-07-07 12:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878152, 543320, 41794, '<td valign="top">Looks like he has a thousand stories to tell and a photo like this really garners my interest into what those stories would be.</td>', 'Looks like he has a thousand stories to tell and a photo like this really garners my interest into what those stories would be.', '2007-07-07 12:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878153, 545335, 41794, '<td valign="top">Great detail and DOF. I love birds of prey and you really captured this one beautifully.</td>', 'Great detail and DOF. I love birds of prey and you really captured this one beautifully.', '2007-07-07 12:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878156, 545462, 41794, '<td valign="top">I just love the carefree nature of this photo. Very candid feel - the happiness on both their faces is so evident.</td>', 'I just love the carefree nature of this photo. Very candid feel - the happiness on both their faces is so evident.', '2007-07-07 12:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878160, 543276, 41794, '<td valign="top">Was this in the wild? It is an amazing capture of the interaction between these beautiful animals. She almost looks like she is scolding him for something and he has that "yes dear" look on his face. Love it!</td>', 'Was this in the wild? It is an amazing capture of the interaction between these beautiful animals. She almost looks like she is scolding him for something and he has that "yes dear" look on his face. Love it!', '2007-07-07 12:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878161, 545528, 41794, '<td valign="top">So simple yet so perfect...I love the rippled lines in the sand leading the viewer deeper and deeper into the dunes.</td>', 'So simple yet so perfect...I love the rippled lines in the sand leading the viewer deeper and deeper into the dunes.', '2007-07-07 12:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878165, 545826, 41794, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait - I think my favorite of the challenge. You don''t often see bride photos with sunflowers, but it works perfectly here. The soft glow at the edges and the dof are great.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait - I think my favorite of the challenge. You don''t often see bride photos with sunflowers, but it works perfectly here. The soft glow at the edges and the dof are great.', '2007-07-07 12:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878170, 544609, 41794, '<td valign="top">Very intent look on her face. And is it just me, or is her tail bobbed?</td>', 'Very intent look on her face. And is it just me, or is her tail bobbed?', '2007-07-07 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878172, 541084, 41794, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait of a very unusual bird!</td>', 'Fantastic portrait of a very unusual bird!', '2007-07-07 12:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878175, 543950, 41794, '<td valign="top">Its funny - even before I saw the title - the first word that came to my mind when I saw this photo was feral. She really looks like someone that was found wandering in the woods after being raised by wolves or something. Especially with that piercing gaze. Well executed photo - bumping up.</td>', 'Its funny - even before I saw the title - the first word that came to my mind when I saw this photo was feral. She really looks like someone that was found wandering in the woods after being raised by wolves or something. Especially with that piercing gaze. Well executed photo - bumping up.', '2007-07-07 12:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878179, 546171, 41794, '<td valign="top">Love this portrait - the earthy tones and subtle glow add to the effect.</td>', 'Love this portrait - the earthy tones and subtle glow add to the effect.', '2007-07-07 12:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878180, 528427, 41794, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sunset photo. The silhouettes of the palm trees right in front of the sun are beautiful.</td>', 'Wonderful sunset photo. The silhouettes of the palm trees right in front of the sun are beautiful.', '2007-07-07 12:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3878183, 541269, 41794, '<td valign="top">I like the retro style done with this portrait. Looks like the portraits they would do in the olden days of the Indian Chiefs.<br/>Will enjoy seeing the details about this shot - like where you took the photo. I am fascinated by all things Native American and would love to be able to take a photo of them dressed in full regalia like this.</td>', 'I like the retro style done with this portrait. Looks like the portraits they would do in the olden days of the Indian Chiefs.Will enjoy seeing the details about this shot - like where you took the photo. I am fascinated by all things Native American and would love to be able to take a photo of them dressed in full regalia like this.', '2007-07-07 12:32:42.000000', NULL, 1);
