(3880677, 537032, 25355, '<td valign="top">I guess it didn''t do too well because of the upside-down aspect, and the way the woman''s contorted face looks by being upside-down (and the strong light that falls on her face). Perhaps, also, the way the man''s arms are cut off on the edges.</td>', 'I guess it didn''t do too well because of the upside-down aspect, and the way the woman''s contorted face looks by being upside-down (and the strong light that falls on her face). Perhaps, also, the way the man''s arms are cut off on the edges.', '2007-07-08 03:47:24.000000', NULL, 0),
