(3880716, 543558, 772, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 10.  This type of photo is a small slice of life that not many people seem to appreciate.  This is a photo that your daughter will cherish one day :)  It''s also a good photo to save for a table display at her wedding reception :)  Candid moments like this one are quite hard to come by.  It''s too bad that most folks around here can''t find a great appreciation for stuff like this... <br/> <br/>Great work :)</td>', 'I gave this photo a 10.  This type of photo is a small slice of life that not many people seem to appreciate.  This is a photo that your daughter will cherish one day :)  It''s also a good photo to save for a table display at her wedding reception :)  Candid moments like this one are quite hard to come by.  It''s too bad that most folks around here can''t find a great appreciation for stuff like this...  Great work :)', '2007-07-08 04:13:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3880718, 545783, 30982, '<td valign="top">I very much like this version of a peacock - everyone always takes pics of their showy tails, and this focuses on their equally gorgeous head plummage.</td>', 'I very much like this version of a peacock - everyone always takes pics of their showy tails, and this focuses on their equally gorgeous head plummage.', '2007-07-08 04:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3880722, 545284, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s always fun to see that some of the shots I really liked in challenges come from Team Suckers.  This is one of them.  It''s quiet, lovely, and gentle.  I love the contrast of the colors - the plant against the background.  I think this is very well done.</td>', 'It''s always fun to see that some of the shots I really liked in challenges come from Team Suckers.  This is one of them.  It''s quiet, lovely, and gentle.  I love the contrast of the colors - the plant against the background.  I think this is very well done.', '2007-07-08 04:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
