(3880971, 546176, 57060, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the more interesting shots in hte challenge, I like it too, but needed to think about it before I could tell. These kind of shots never do well, it''s just the way the voting works. Most important of course is your own take, but also know that a number of people will like it too. Great job, Jack</td>', 'Definitely one of the more interesting shots in hte challenge, I like it too, but needed to think about it before I could tell. These kind of shots never do well, it''s just the way the voting works. Most important of course is your own take, but also know that a number of people will like it too. Great job, Jack', '2007-07-08 08:06:59.000000', NULL, 0),
