(3881027, 542236, 67697, '<td valign="top">And here I thought this was the place to go to get figs..<br/> <br/>I did not vote in the Free Study this round so I am just seeing a lot of photos for the first time.  I''m surprised this scored so low but then again, this is Free Study and a whole new level of voting criteria applies.  I think it is a good photo and you do get a sense of strong concentration from your subject.  The one thing you will find as you go on is that you don''t need the title to explain the photo - you will want the viewers to guess what is going on.<br/> <br/>Good clarity, good composition, and I hope she did well!</td>', 'And here I thought this was the place to go to get figs.. I did not vote in the Free Study this round so I am just seeing a lot of photos for the first time.  I''m surprised this scored so low but then again, this is Free Study and a whole new level of voting criteria applies.  I think it is a good photo and you do get a sense of strong concentration from your subject.  The one thing you will find as you go on is that you don''t need the title to explain the photo - you will want the viewers to guess what is going on. Good clarity, good composition, and I hope she did well!', '2007-07-08 08:26:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3881054, 545783, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well I think it is a gorgeous photo and I love the blue!  It looks in focus to me and I love that the bird is staring into the neg space.  Pretty photo!</td>', 'Well I think it is a gorgeous photo and I love the blue!  It looks in focus to me and I love that the bird is staring into the neg space.  Pretty photo!', '2007-07-08 08:31:45.000000', NULL, 0),
