(3881831, 545788, 68586, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I''m really not sure why this didn''t do better.<br/> <br/>The lighting , colour and composition are all nicely done, the only thing I would have considered is a border around it to help seperate the solid black background from the solid grey of the site background (but that''s just personal taste).<br/> <br/>I still like it  :  )</td>', 'Good shot. I''m really not sure why this didn''t do better. The lighting , colour and composition are all nicely done, the only thing I would have considered is a border around it to help seperate the solid black background from the solid grey of the site background (but that''s just personal taste). I still like it  :  )', '2007-07-08 12:46:47.000000', NULL, 0),
