(3881879, 545278, 31403, '<td valign="top">I wondered where this was taken.  In the US if you point a camera at an aircraft this close to the ground you''re just asking to meet a lot of uptight men in uniform.<br/> <br/>Another great photo that isn''t targeted to the DPC demographic.  I enjoyed the variation in the challenge.</td>', 'I wondered where this was taken.  In the US if you point a camera at an aircraft this close to the ground you''re just asking to meet a lot of uptight men in uniform. Another great photo that isn''t targeted to the DPC demographic.  I enjoyed the variation in the challenge.', '2007-07-08 13:04:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3881890, 545907, 43565, '<td valign="top">It seems like you took it in bright sunlight, or maybe its just over saturated.  Either way, it has a harsh look to me.  I like the bee on the flower, but it seems too close of a crop on the flower, and a softer light or less processing might bring out more detail in the center of the flower and the bee.  Personally I would try to tone down the yellow overtones in the green of the background, but I am always taking out some yellow so it is probably just me.</td>', 'It seems like you took it in bright sunlight, or maybe its just over saturated.  Either way, it has a harsh look to me.  I like the bee on the flower, but it seems too close of a crop on the flower, and a softer light or less processing might bring out more detail in the center of the flower and the bee.  Personally I would try to tone down the yellow overtones in the green of the background, but I am always taking out some yellow so it is probably just me.', '2007-07-08 13:10:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3881892, 546028, 79604, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by annig:</b></div><hr/><i> Hi Evelyn~<br/>nice lighting and detail here...the stargazer lily, so pretty. Perhaps a less demanding border?   These Free Study challenges are a tough row!  good finish!<br/>~Anni </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the border comment...I am learning that less is more! Wish I would have submitted sans border or with a tiny white border. Changed my July free study entry from a border like this to a small white border.</td>', 'Originally posted by annig: Hi Evelyn~nice lighting and detail here...the stargazer lily, so pretty. Perhaps a less demanding border?   These Free Study challenges are a tough row!  good finish!~Anni   Thanks for the border comment...I am learning that less is more! Wish I would have submitted sans border or with a tiny white border. Changed my July free study entry from a border like this to a small white border.', '2007-07-08 13:15:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3881898, 544523, 64458, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top ten finish David! It''s a very stunning shot! I have never seen it composed this way before.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top ten finish David! It''s a very stunning shot! I have never seen it composed this way before.', '2007-07-08 13:17:45.000000', NULL, 0),
