(3882933, 544418, 34938, '<td valign="top">should have been a ribbon winner Lesley. I thought this moght have been one of yours actually. That you got to track leaopards for a week makes me insanely jealous. I was in Kenya and saw three in one day, one of which stalked prey about 200 metres away, but backed off when a bird started skwaking. The detail and light in this really amazes me, and the exposure is certainly perfect. One of my favourites and you got a 10 from me.</td>', 'should have been a ribbon winner Lesley. I thought this moght have been one of yours actually. That you got to track leaopards for a week makes me insanely jealous. I was in Kenya and saw three in one day, one of which stalked prey about 200 metres away, but backed off when a bird started skwaking. The detail and light in this really amazes me, and the exposure is certainly perfect. One of my favourites and you got a 10 from me.', '2007-07-08 19:19:25.000000', NULL, 0),
