(3883043, 541455, 76430, '<td valign="top">Sorry you didn''t get more comments on this one other than a "9" from your one 9.  I''m one of your (4) 8''s, and I thought it was very good. I love the bridge and the old and new buildings in the background.  All I can suggest is that maybe if all 4 sides were cropped so there would not be so many distractions, and the bridge and church(?) at the end of the bridge would be the main features, then the people on the bridge would also have a more prominent part of it.</td>', 'Sorry you didn''t get more comments on this one other than a "9" from your one 9.  I''m one of your (4) 8''s, and I thought it was very good. I love the bridge and the old and new buildings in the background.  All I can suggest is that maybe if all 4 sides were cropped so there would not be so many distractions, and the bridge and church(?) at the end of the bridge would be the main features, then the people on the bridge would also have a more prominent part of it.', '2007-07-08 20:21:55.000000', NULL, 0),
