(3883356, 540787, 65858, '<td valign="top">Thanks Steve - this is indeed just a snapshot of my wife at the kitchen table.  I liked her natural expression, so I worked up the lighting and desat in PS.  I''d love to produce images similar to this out of the camera some day - but I''ll need to work on lighting.  =)<br/> <br/>With the light/colors, I was going for a look similar to one of my favorite shots on this site: <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=20462" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Cutter</a>''s Snowbound Simpleton:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=431266" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/590/thumb/431266.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/590/thumb/431266.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/590/thumb/431266.jpg"/></a> <br/></td>', 'Thanks Steve - this is indeed just a snapshot of my wife at the kitchen table.  I liked her natural expression, so I worked up the lighting and desat in PS.  I''d love to produce images similar to this out of the camera some day - but I''ll need to work on lighting.  =) With the light/colors, I was going for a look similar to one of my favorite shots on this site:  Cutter''s Snowbound Simpleton:  ', '2007-07-08 22:08:17.000000', NULL, 0),
