(3883671, 531327, 66597, '<td valign="top">Barbara - I really love this - I was one of your 7''s teetering on an 8. In fact, the only thing that kept me from scoring just a tad higher was that I find the fluorescent lights in the back right to distract from the beautiful line of chairs and old timer. With just a touch of burning in that area I think you''d have something even more stunning - and it''s gorgeous as it is.</td>', 'Barbara - I really love this - I was one of your 7''s teetering on an 8. In fact, the only thing that kept me from scoring just a tad higher was that I find the fluorescent lights in the back right to distract from the beautiful line of chairs and old timer. With just a touch of burning in that area I think you''d have something even more stunning - and it''s gorgeous as it is.', '2007-07-08 23:52:13.000000', NULL, 0),
