(3883700, 545949, 67145, '<td valign="top">yep, i''m with jon .. cant work out the score either ... i do think that you''re high contrast shadow guy might''v gone better, but i''m usually wrong trying to gauge wot the the voters like ... i love the atmospheric feel to this image .. the lamp is excellent and so stark against that gorgeous dark sky coming down to the glow on the horizon  .. i feel that it may have been the darkness that gave you the low score, but trying to please to the majority is very difficult .. i''ve found in dpc that sometimes entries made by the most artistic, original and creative photographers often just dont appeal to a lot of voters .. :)</td>', 'yep, i''m with jon .. cant work out the score either ... i do think that you''re high contrast shadow guy might''v gone better, but i''m usually wrong trying to gauge wot the the voters like ... i love the atmospheric feel to this image .. the lamp is excellent and so stark against that gorgeous dark sky coming down to the glow on the horizon  .. i feel that it may have been the darkness that gave you the low score, but trying to please to the majority is very difficult .. i''ve found in dpc that sometimes entries made by the most artistic, original and creative photographers often just dont appeal to a lot of voters .. :)', '2007-07-08 23:59:15.000000', NULL, 0),
