(3892254, 541212, 21816, '<td valign="top">I like this photo and the way it''s processed. The only thing that eats at me is that it appears a little red/orange? I love the sharp focus and detail of the eyes and the crop. Should of finished higher in the rankings but that''s DPC for ya! Great shot!</td>', 'I like this photo and the way it''s processed. The only thing that eats at me is that it appears a little red/orange? I love the sharp focus and detail of the eyes and the crop. Should of finished higher in the rankings but that''s DPC for ya! Great shot!', '2007-07-11 07:42:48.000000', NULL, 0),
