(3903837, 543991, 73414, '<td valign="top">Jay! It''s been a while--I love this! It''s beautiful! This kid''s eyes are unbelievable.Sorry I wasn''t here to vote.</td>', 'Jay! It''s been a while--I love this! It''s beautiful! This kid''s eyes are unbelievable.Sorry I wasn''t here to vote.', '2007-07-14 22:05:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3903975, 545907, 48228, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of this one so much, and also the fine detail that you have captured. <br/>I feel you deserved a much higher score than this, as it is a beautiful image..... <br/>So bright, so colorful and so good.....<br/>Almost like spring or summer at its best.....</td>', 'I love the colors of this one so much, and also the fine detail that you have captured. I feel you deserved a much higher score than this, as it is a beautiful image..... So bright, so colorful and so good.....Almost like spring or summer at its best.....', '2007-07-14 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3904727, 540582, 24389, '<td valign="top">nice job, its very sharp, skin tone looks great, maybe a little overexposed (teeth are bright). and i like the border.</td>', 'nice job, its very sharp, skin tone looks great, maybe a little overexposed (teeth are bright). and i like the border.', '2007-07-15 10:20:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3904913, 545433, 66384, '<td valign="top">Aw, my husband and I had a bichon for 16.5 years. He''s been gone for about 6 years now, and we still miss him. What a joyful and loving breed that is!<br/> <br/>This is a great score and placement for a Free Study. Congratulations on a very good entry. I have a feeling that the blown highlights on his back may be what prevented it from scoring above 6 -- the subject, composition, simplicity, focus, and color are all excellent (IMO).</td>', 'Aw, my husband and I had a bichon for 16.5 years. He''s been gone for about 6 years now, and we still miss him. What a joyful and loving breed that is! This is a great score and placement for a Free Study. Congratulations on a very good entry. I have a feeling that the blown highlights on his back may be what prevented it from scoring above 6 -- the subject, composition, simplicity, focus, and color are all excellent (IMO).', '2007-07-15 11:50:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3904924, 545886, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice low key image! I can see why you are yearning for lights now. I must admit that when I first saw this (I already knew it was yours) I thought you had been shooting store windows again. Then I noticed that the skin didn''t look plastic. What a great experience you had. Congratulations on a well deserved terrific score, especially for a Free Study.</td>', 'Nice low key image! I can see why you are yearning for lights now. I must admit that when I first saw this (I already knew it was yours) I thought you had been shooting store windows again. Then I noticed that the skin didn''t look plastic. What a great experience you had. Congratulations on a well deserved terrific score, especially for a Free Study.', '2007-07-15 11:56:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3904931, 546168, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love it. From the thumbnail, I thought it was another mediocre fireworks shot. What a nice surprise I had when I opened the full shot. The lighting, color, and focus are great, and I like the placement against the black background. What a huge difference between the commenter''s score, and the final average, and some of the commenters didn''t even like it. Well, I like it, and agree that it would be much better in a large print.</td>', 'Love it. From the thumbnail, I thought it was another mediocre fireworks shot. What a nice surprise I had when I opened the full shot. The lighting, color, and focus are great, and I like the placement against the black background. What a huge difference between the commenter''s score, and the final average, and some of the commenters didn''t even like it. Well, I like it, and agree that it would be much better in a large print.', '2007-07-15 12:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3905087, 544536, 64994, '<td valign="top">This was a ribbon pick for me, I can''t believe it didn''t place higher!</td>', 'This was a ribbon pick for me, I can''t believe it didn''t place higher!', '2007-07-15 13:34:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3905151, 539248, 63269, '<td valign="top">Exquisite. Strait from a fantasy world. I love this. The colors, the shadows and tones creeping in from the edges,  and the sparkles of purple against the glowing green.... Beautiful.</td>', 'Exquisite. Strait from a fantasy world. I love this. The colors, the shadows and tones creeping in from the edges,  and the sparkles of purple against the glowing green.... Beautiful.', '2007-07-15 14:17:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3905511, 546173, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of lighting and high contrast. Brilliant work.<br/> <br/>And yes, totally under-rated. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-15 16:56:15.</i></td>', 'Wonderful use of lighting and high contrast. Brilliant work. And yes, totally under-rated. ', '2007-07-15 17:55:43.000000', '2007-07-15 17:56:15.000000', 0),
(3905682, 544536, 67145, '<td valign="top">this looks so good on your profile page ... congratulations on a wonderful photograph and a great place in the free study and of course a pb ... average of 8 for all commenters .. over 50 ppl gave you a 7 or over ... this is awesome .. i hope this makes up for the construction work dragging on .. :):)xx</td>', 'this looks so good on your profile page ... congratulations on a wonderful photograph and a great place in the free study and of course a pb ... average of 8 for all commenters .. over 50 ppl gave you a 7 or over ... this is awesome .. i hope this makes up for the construction work dragging on .. :):)xx', '2007-07-15 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3905709, 545461, 13897, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JohnLampkin:</b></div><hr/><i> Why sharpen the water? Ugh. Blur would have been much more effective. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>John, That''s what water looks like at 1/1000 shutter speed. I didn''t sharpen it at all. Ugh.</td>', 'Originally posted by JohnLampkin: Why sharpen the water? Ugh. Blur would have been much more effective.   John, That''s what water looks like at 1/1000 shutter speed. I didn''t sharpen it at all. Ugh.', '2007-07-15 19:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
