(3992367, 543417, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmm? Not really sure what kind of comment you would like. Wow, I just realized it was in a Free Study Challenge and got no comments - that seems very strange to me! Anyway, I think what ''hurt'' it was the composition. I think there should have been more space below the boat? It looks like it has some high flying birds - they might have been taken for sensor dust? The colors are very nice. Maybe the blue part of the sky could have been more blue? The focus is very, very nice. But hey, what they heck do I know?!?!?!?! Hope that helps somewhat...</td>', 'Hmm? Not really sure what kind of comment you would like. Wow, I just realized it was in a Free Study Challenge and got no comments - that seems very strange to me! Anyway, I think what ''hurt'' it was the composition. I think there should have been more space below the boat? It looks like it has some high flying birds - they might have been taken for sensor dust? The colors are very nice. Maybe the blue part of the sky could have been more blue? The focus is very, very nice. But hey, what they heck do I know?!?!?!?! Hope that helps somewhat...', '2007-08-13 04:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
