(4038143, 546055, 63267, '<td valign="top">This brings back memories of when I was a kid, learning about the missions in California.  My great aunt lived in San Juan Capistrano and we would go visit her often until her passing.  It was always something to see the old mission there.  Interestingly enough, the missions in California were built far enough away from each other that it would take a day''s walk to reach the next mission.<br/> <br/>You have captured this mission very nice.  I like the tone to the image, the reflection and the way the sun rays are visible in the top part of the picture.<br/> <br/>Thank you for bringing back the memories of the missions, and of my great aunt.</td>', 'This brings back memories of when I was a kid, learning about the missions in California.  My great aunt lived in San Juan Capistrano and we would go visit her often until her passing.  It was always something to see the old mission there.  Interestingly enough, the missions in California were built far enough away from each other that it would take a day''s walk to reach the next mission. You have captured this mission very nice.  I like the tone to the image, the reflection and the way the sun rays are visible in the top part of the picture. Thank you for bringing back the memories of the missions, and of my great aunt.', '2007-08-29 11:36:15.000000', NULL, 0),
