(4066026, 544360, 82694, '<td valign="top">this is a gorgeous shot. I love the colors, and the way the sunlight peeks through the trees. :)</td>', 'this is a gorgeous shot. I love the colors, and the way the sunlight peeks through the trees. :)', '2007-09-06 16:58:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4067325, 531383, 19831, '<td valign="top">I find this to be a really stunning image. Just gorgeous! One thing that is definitely really cool to me is, that it is kind of breaking a couple ''rules'', but in a way that works wonderfully here, and I love it when people do that. First, she is looking off the frame she is close to, but it works here, it leaves me sorely wishing I was there with her, soaking in the full beauty of this place. Second, there are these dark areas, so dark that there is no detail, just blackness, but man, the black is in just all the right places, and makes the girl, the water, the greens and the rocks really, really pop out! It all comes together in just a beautiful, flowing composition. Your processing is lovely, I quite like it. On the verge it would seem of appearing ''heavy handed'' to some tastes maybe, but to me, it feels very tasteful, and comes across as a style, that looks great, and not at all ''overdone''. I think the saturation is wonderful. The greens, and the hues of the rocks really punch through, and look great. The girl does have a wonderful ''glow''. The image does have a fantasy feel for sure. You definitely deserve, and should be very proud of this photo. I love it. Thank you for sharing such a beautiful masterpiece. :-)</td>', 'I find this to be a really stunning image. Just gorgeous! One thing that is definitely really cool to me is, that it is kind of breaking a couple ''rules'', but in a way that works wonderfully here, and I love it when people do that. First, she is looking off the frame she is close to, but it works here, it leaves me sorely wishing I was there with her, soaking in the full beauty of this place. Second, there are these dark areas, so dark that there is no detail, just blackness, but man, the black is in just all the right places, and makes the girl, the water, the greens and the rocks really, really pop out! It all comes together in just a beautiful, flowing composition. Your processing is lovely, I quite like it. On the verge it would seem of appearing ''heavy handed'' to some tastes maybe, but to me, it feels very tasteful, and comes across as a style, that looks great, and not at all ''overdone''. I think the saturation is wonderful. The greens, and the hues of the rocks really punch through, and look great. The girl does have a wonderful ''glow''. The image does have a fantasy feel for sure. You definitely deserve, and should be very proud of this photo. I love it. Thank you for sharing such a beautiful masterpiece. :-)', '2007-09-07 00:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
