(4162941, 538560, 68586, '<td valign="top">Wendy - nice shot.<br/> <br/>I think there is a lot of hidden detail in here which may have been overlooked by many.<br/> <br/>Whether they are actually brothers or not, I like the fact that one has blonde hair and the other brown, one is in green and one is in red, and the great positioning.<br/> <br/>A very nice, happy, feel-good shot. It may have been technically better if it had been on a white background - but on the other hand may have taken away from the relaxed expressions . . so who knows  :-  )<br/> <br/>Might be fun to redo on a white background though with a <br/>light border.<br/> <br/>edit for spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-12 15:05:37.</i></td>', 'Wendy - nice shot. I think there is a lot of hidden detail in here which may have been overlooked by many. Whether they are actually brothers or not, I like the fact that one has blonde hair and the other brown, one is in green and one is in red, and the great positioning. A very nice, happy, feel-good shot. It may have been technically better if it had been on a white background - but on the other hand may have taken away from the relaxed expressions . . so who knows  :-  ) Might be fun to redo on a white background though with a light border. edit for spelling', '2007-10-12 13:50:50.000000', '2007-10-12 16:05:37.000000', 0),
