(5184504, 545779, 37252, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot! I really think it should have ribboned.<br/>The details are remarkable. The elephant so expressive. And I love you pp editing. I don''t know why I never came across this before - but had I it would have been right to my fav''s, which is where is is now. :)</td>', 'This is a stunning shot! I really think it should have ribboned.The details are remarkable. The elephant so expressive. And I love you pp editing. I don''t know why I never came across this before - but had I it would have been right to my fav''s, which is where is is now. :)', '2009-01-11 07:13:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5200417, 546055, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hey! I''ve been here and I''ve shot this! Long ago... Maybe 1976? 1978? Anyway, this is beautifully post processed. It''s not easy to make backlit adobe look so natural and still so luminous :-)</td>', 'Hey! I''ve been here and I''ve shot this! Long ago... Maybe 1976? 1978? Anyway, this is beautifully post processed. It''s not easy to make backlit adobe look so natural and still so luminous :-)', '2009-01-17 22:45:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5257471, 544536, 82749, '<td valign="top">I like the element of mystery here.  Great lighting, tones, composition as well.</td>', 'I like the element of mystery here.  Great lighting, tones, composition as well.', '2009-02-15 11:36:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5275191, 545905, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOW .. this is exceptional .. the most amazing photograph ever .. <br/>words could never express how incredible i think this is .. so i wont go on .. just that there''s so much about this that i love, including your brilliant title .. :)</td>', 'WOW .. this is exceptional .. the most amazing photograph ever .. words could never express how incredible i think this is .. so i wont go on .. just that there''s so much about this that i love, including your brilliant title .. :)', '2009-02-25 21:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
